# No trailing slash: a symlinked node_modules (a linked local dependency) is not
# a directory, and `node_modules/` would let the link be committed.
node_modules

# The build (`bun run build`), stamped with the commit it is of; `run.sh` serves it only when the
# stamp is HEAD. Never committed: a checked-in copy is a second answer to "what does this page say".
dist

# Written by `build.ts` for the length of a build and taken away after. Left behind by a killed
# build, it would be what Vite answers at `/`, with no ticket in it.
/index.html

# What this module keeps while you try it on itself: never committed.
.kehikot

.DS_Store
